guide.crockpot.farming.title=Farming
guide.crockpot.farming.body=Plantable crops: Asparagus, Corn, Eggplant, Garlic, Onion, Pepper, Tomato.\nUnknown Seeds: 10% chance to drop from breaking grass or tall grass. Plant them to randomly grow into one of the 7 crops above.\nSeed sources: Breaking mature crops, feeding parrots with crops, or crafting crops into seeds.

guide.crockpot.entities.title=Entities
guide.crockpot.entities.body=Volt Goat and Milk Bottle.
guide.crockpot.entity.volt_goat.body=Volt Goats spawn in Badlands.\nNormal Goats turn into Volt Goats when struck by lightning.\nWhen struck by lightning again, they enter a charged state and gain the Charge effect.\nCharged Volt Goats are no longer neutral to players, they actively attack any player that comes near.\nThe charged state lasts for 2 in-game days before returning to normal.\nDrops Volt Goat Horn.
guide.crockpot.entity.milk_bottle.body=Obtain: Right-click Cows, Mooshrooms, Volt Goats, or Goats with a glass bottle.\nFood Value: §bDairy§r × 1.\nDrinking it clears all status effects.

guide.crockpot.effects.title=Effects
guide.crockpot.effects.body=This pack adds 4 custom effects.
guide.crockpot.effect.charge.body=Source: Volt Goat Chaud-Froid, lasts 360s.\nBase attack damage +35%.\nWhen attacking wet targets, deals an additional 30% damage.
guide.crockpot.effect.well_fed.body=Source: Bunny Stew, lasts 120s.\nAttacks deal +1 flat damage.\nHeals 1 HP when taking ≥2 damage.
guide.crockpot.effect.wither_resistance.body=Source: Mushy Cake, lasts 60s.\nImmediately clears existing Wither; grants immunity to Wither effect while active.
guide.crockpot.effect.ocean_affinity.body=Source: Tropical Bouillabaisse, lasts 150s.\nIncreases the player's swimming speed by 15%.

guide.crockpot.thanks.title=Credits
